{"_id":"692488477c7d1fa20e76823d","roadmapSlug":"elasticsearch","nodeId":"rWriosjh7LzGZbj8k_wih","description":"# Elasticsearch\n\nElasticsearch is a distributed, open-source search and analytics engine for all types of data, including textual, numerical, geospatial, structured, and unstructured. It's built on Apache Lucene and provides a distributed, multitenant-capable full-text search engine with an HTTP web interface and schema-free JSON documents. Elasticsearch is commonly used for log analytics, full-text search, security intelligence, business analytics, and operational intelligence use cases.","resources":[{"type":"book","title":"Elasticsearch The Definitive Guide","url":"https://hlaszny.com/booksAndPapers/buckets/b8_IT/elasticsearch-the-definitive-guide.pdf","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afbd"},{"type":"official","title":"Elasticsearch","url":"https://www.elastic.co/elasticsearch","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afbe"},{"type":"official","title":"Elasticsearch solution overview","url":"https://www.elastic.co/docs/solutions/search","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afbf"},{"type":"official","title":"Get started with Elasticsearch","url":"https://www.elastic.co/docs/solutions/search/get-started","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc0"},{"type":"official","title":"Elasticsearch Labs Tutorial","url":"https://www.elastic.co/search-labs/tutorials","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc1"},{"type":"article","title":"Elasticsearch Tutorial","url":"https://www.tutorialspoint.com/elasticsearch/index.htm","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc2"},{"type":"video","title":"Elasticsearch Course for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a4HBKEda_F8","_id":"69284397467651eddb61afc3"}],"createdAt":"2025-11-24T16:31:03.201Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-27T12:27:03.094Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/elasticsearch/content/rWriosjh7LzGZbj8k_wih.md"}